# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-07
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Name | Provider | Recommended use | Unique benefits |\n"
"|---|---|---|---|\n"
"| Tensor-Network Error Mitigation<br/><br/>[Guide](/guides/algorithmiq-tem)<br/>[API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/algorithmiq-tem)<br/>[License](https://ibm.box.com/s/cbvfdhv3i0vnwv4sxkdpp3pcvip27atd)      | Algorithmiq  | Workloads that have low-weight observables and loop-free circuits. | Reduces measurement overhead and variance, outperforming standard error mitigation baselines such as Zero Noise Extrapolation (ZNE) and Probabilistic Error Cancellation (PEC) for relevant circuit classes. |\n"
"| QESEM: Error Suppression and Error Mitigation<br/><br/>[Guide](/guides/qedma-qesem)<br/>[API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/qedma-qesem)    | Qedma        | Workloads that  include circuits with fractional or parameterized gates, high-weight observables,  and workflows that require unbiased expectation values and accurate runtime estimates. | Produces unbiased expectation values with lower variance and resource overhead, outperforming ZNE and PEC for relevant circuit classes. |\n"
"| Performance Management<br/><br/>[Guide](/guides/q-ctrl-performance-management)<br/>[API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/q-ctrl-performance-management)<br/>[License](https://ibm.box.com/s/ly9cs0lxy6nxqrirt5rt1xisnmvydj9z) | Q-CTRL       | Workloads that contain parametric circuits, deep circuits, or require many circuit executions. | Automatically applies AI-driven error suppression to quantum algorithms, maximizing the performance of IBM devices to deliver accurate results while reducing the number of shots, compute time, and cost required. <br/><br/>Zero-overhead method that improves execution accuracy for the Sampler and the Estimator primitives, compatible with any weight of observables. |\n"
"| Orbit<br/><br/>[Guide](/guides/quantum-elements-orbit)<br/>[API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/quantum-elements-orbit) | Quantum Elements | Workloads containing idle periods or scheduling gaps, including static and dynamic circuits such as quantum error correction, mid-circuit measurement, oracular algorithms, variational quantum algorithms, and Hamiltonian simulation. | Combines optimized transpilation, dynamical decoupling, and measurement error mitigation into a unified workflow to improve circuit performance on IBM Quantum hardware. <br/><br/>Applies low-overhead error suppression that preserves the original circuit logic without additional quantum or classical pre-processing time, so that users can enable, disable, or compare each technique against the raw circuit. |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Nama | Penyedia | Penggunaan yang disyorkan | Kelebihan unik |\n"
"|---|---|---|---|\n"
"| Tensor-Network Error Mitigation<br/><br/>[Panduan](/guides/algorithmiq-tem)<br/>[Rujukan API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/algorithmiq-tem)<br/>[Lesen](https://ibm.box.com/s/cbvfdhv3i0vnwv4sxkdpp3pcvip27atd)      | Algorithmiq  | Beban kerja yang mempunyai boleh cerap berpemberat rendah dan litar bebas gelung. | Mengurangkan overhed pengukuran dan varians, mengatasi garis asas mitigasi ralat standard seperti Zero Noise Extrapolation (ZNE) dan Probabilistic Error Cancellation (PEC) untuk kelas litar yang berkaitan. |\n"
"| QESEM: Penindasan Ralat dan Mitigasi Ralat<br/><br/>[Panduan](/guides/qedma-qesem)<br/>[Rujukan API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/qedma-qesem)    | Qedma        | Beban kerja yang merangkumi litar dengan Gate pecahan atau berparameter, boleh cerap berpemberat tinggi, dan aliran kerja yang memerlukan nilai jangkaan saksama serta anggaran masa jalan yang tepat. | Menghasilkan nilai jangkaan saksama dengan varians dan overhed sumber yang lebih rendah, mengatasi ZNE dan PEC untuk kelas litar yang berkaitan. |\n"
"| Pengurusan Prestasi<br/><br/>[Panduan](/guides/q-ctrl-performance-management)<br/>[Rujukan API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/q-ctrl-performance-management)<br/>[Lesen](https://ibm.box.com/s/ly9cs0lxy6nxqrirt5rt1xisnmvydj9z) | Q-CTRL       | Beban kerja yang mengandungi litar berparametrik, litar dalam, atau memerlukan banyak pelaksanaan litar. | Secara automatik menerapkan penindasan ralat dipacu AI pada algoritma kuantum, memaksimumkan prestasi peranti IBM untuk menghasilkan keputusan yang tepat sambil mengurangkan bilangan tembakan, masa pengiraan, dan kos yang diperlukan. <br/><br/>Kaedah sifar-overhed yang meningkatkan ketepatan pelaksanaan untuk primitif Sampler dan Estimator, serasi dengan boleh cerap pada sebarang pemberat. |\n"
"| Orbit<br/><br/>[Panduan](/guides/quantum-elements-orbit)<br/>[Rujukan API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/quantum-elements-orbit) | Quantum Elements | Beban kerja yang mengandungi tempoh melahu atau jurang penjadualan, termasuk litar statik dan dinamik seperti pembetulan ralat kuantum, pengukuran pertengahan litar, algoritma oracular, algoritma kuantum variasional, dan simulasi Hamiltonian. | Menggabungkan transpilasi teroptimum, dynamical decoupling, dan mitigasi ralat pengukuran ke dalam satu aliran kerja bersepadu untuk meningkatkan prestasi litar pada perkakasan IBM Quantum. <br/><br/>Menerapkan penindasan ralat overhed rendah yang mengekalkan logik litar asal tanpa masa pra-pemprosesan kuantum atau klasik tambahan, supaya pengguna boleh mengaktifkan, menyahaktifkan, atau membandingkan setiap teknik dengan litar mentah. |\n"

